{"unit_id":"tag:06EP:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。令<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）的性质。令<MATH_0004>。称<MATH_0005>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0006>关于源局部的（local on the source）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，或<TEXTITOPEN_0002>对于以下拓扑关于源局部的（local on the source for the）<MATH_0007>拓扑（topology）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果对<MATH_0009>上代数空间的任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>，以及代数空间（algebraic spaces）的任意<MATH_0010>覆盖（covering）<MATH_0011>，有\n<MATHSEG_0001>具有<MATHSEG_0002>每个<MATHSEG_0003>具有<MATHSEG_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"local on the source","target_term":"关于源局部的"},{"source_term":"local on the source for the","target_term":"对于以下拓扑关于源局部的"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射和覆盖对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"性质对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"local on the source","target_term":"关于源局部的","context":"定义术语；待决。"},{"source_term":"local on the source for the","target_term":"对于以下拓扑关于源局部的","context":"定义术语；待决。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"局部性拓扑；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"测试态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"局部覆盖；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
